<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>About EngineerLaunch</title><style>body{margin:0;color:#10213e;font:17px/1.7 Inter,system-ui;background:#f6f8fc}.wrap{width:min(920px,calc(100% - 32px));margin:auto}header{padding:65px 0;color:#fff;background:#0b1933}article{padding:45px 0}section{margin:0 0 35px;padding:28px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e4e9f2;border-radius:14px}h1{font-size:45px;line-height:1.1}h2{line-height:1.25}.journey{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px}.step{padding:14px;background:#eff6ff;border-radius:9px}@media(max-width:650px){.journey{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style></head><body><header><div class="wrap"><a href="/" style="color:#93c5fd">← EngineerLaunch</a><h1>A complete career marketplace for students</h1><p>We bring job discovery, learning, practice and career preparation into one connected platform.</p></div></header><article class="wrap"><section><h2>Who we are</h2><p>EngineerLaunch is being built for students, freshers and professionals who should not need ten different websites to understand what to learn, where to practise and which companies are hiring.</p></section><section><h2>Our mission</h2><p>We aim to make opportunities accessible, transparent and easier to discover. Talent should not miss an opportunity because relevant information was scattered or difficult to find.</p></section><section><h2>Your connected journey</h2><div class="journey">@foreach(['Learn the right skills','Practise regularly','Build your profile','Prepare for interviews','Discover verified openings','Apply at the official source','Keep growing'] as $step)<div class="step">{{ $step }}</div>@endforeach</div></section><section><h2>What we provide</h2><ul><li>Fresh company openings from verified official/public feeds</li><li>Filters by skill, role, experience, location and working arrangement</li><li>Original engineering learning and interview preparation</li><li>Browser-safe coding practice</li><li>User profiles, progress and application tracking foundations</li></ul></section><section><h2>Our promise</h2><p>We cannot promise that every application results in employment. We can make the journey clearer, preserve source attribution, avoid misleading listings, and help people apply with better information and confidence.</p><blockquote><b>Talent is everywhere. Opportunity should be too.</b></blockquote></section></article></body></html>
